# Cursor Configuration System

This project uses a **completely independent** Cursor configuration system located in `.cursor/`. All configurations are self-contained and do not depend on `.claude/` directory.

## Directory Structure

```
.cursor/
├── rules/
│   ├── agents/          # Agent definitions (.mdc files)
│   ├── commands/        # Command definitions (.mdc files)
│   └── skills/          # Skill definitions (.mdc files)
├── output-styles/       # Output style definitions (.md files)
├── .current-output-style # Current active output style (state file)
└── settings.local.json  # Optional permissions file
```

## Key Points

- **Independence**: All paths reference `.cursor/`, never `.claude/`
- **Self-Contained**: All configurations are within `.cursor/` directory
- **No Dependencies**: This system functions independently of any `.claude/` configuration

## Usage

- Agents: `.cursor/rules/agents/*.mdc`
- Commands: `.cursor/rules/commands/*.mdc`
- Skills: `.cursor/rules/skills/*.mdc`
- Output Styles: `.cursor/output-styles/*.md`
- Current Style: `.cursor/.current-output-style`
